Railway deployment failed — Build Error

Fix the package.json file in your repository, which contains invalid or truncated JSON. Railpack failed to parse it and reported "unexpected EOF at line 2, column 1", so the Node provider could not initialize and the build failed. This was introduced by the "Update package.json" commit, as the previous deployment built successfully.

